  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The Observed Sea Ice Charts represent both air and ship observations which are transmitted to the operations division of the Canadian Ice Service where they are integrated into the Daily Ice Charts. In turn, the Charts provide timely ice information to the marine community operating in ice-encumbered waters in and around Canadian jurisdictional waters in order to enhance the safety and the efficiency of marine operations therein."
